>>> SC3066 2:3

### group ownership test in dash is fine
#!/bin/dash
[ -G shared.db ] && echo "our group"
>>> none

### group ownership test in busybox is fine
#!/bin/busybox sh
# shellcheck shell=busybox
[ -G shared.db ] && echo "our group"
>>> none
